    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Watercress&amp;newwindow=1&amp;rlz=1CAVNCX_enUS1049US1049&amp;sca_esv=89aaa52b873f06b6&amp;biw=1366&amp;bih=599&amp;sxsrf=ANbL-n7LkPzeMkZGjm88z605WABFd1KLkA%3A1770330933132&amp;ei=NRuFaablB7e60PEP4LnZ-QY&amp;oq=Watercress+informa&amp;gs_lp=Egxnd3Mtd2l6LXNlcnAiEldhdGVyY3Jlc3MgaW5mb3JtYSoCCAAyBhAAGBYYHjIGEAAYFhgeMgsQABiABBiGAxiKBTILEAAYgAQYhgMYigUyCxAAGIAEGIYDGIoFMgsQABiABBiGAxiKBTIIEAAYgAQYogQyCBAAGIAEGKIEMggQABiiBBiJBUjUJVDsBFjwGnABeAGQAQCYAcMBoAGRDaoBAzguN7gBA8gBAPgBAZgCD6AC-g3CAgoQABiwAxjWBBhHwgINEAAYgAQYsAMYQxiKBcICDhAAGLADGOQCGNYE2AEBwgITEC4YgAQYsAMYQxjIAxiKBdgBAcICChAjGIAEGCcYigXCAgoQABiABBgUGIcCwgIFEAAYgATCAgUQLhiABMICCBAAGIAEGLEDwgIIEC4YgAQYsQPCAgsQABiABBiRAhiKBcICCxAuGIAEGJECGIoFmAMAiAYBkAYSugYGCAEQARgJkgcENC4xMaAHzIoBsgcEMy4xMbgHxA3CBwYzLTEyLjPIB_cBgAgA&amp;sclient=gws-wiz-serp&amp;mstk=AUtExfAr5O0yBoM3gZmidpFM1QaibzXTKUJ766j1NFnjWS6eXtjz9O_z6nk9RBxuEN8tbz_odIPx9kfSLhqnKpXGWFX4uCwtaudUnDuUXzy1XelTUAFso5GrQNZKl3mH3__xAYoj_nIZp-zhMQ6YOswBxru_7jXbjkxEvEqlD1tpRDkdITIvEHe0sGIzZrfHT_8TB5kY-tGE5vvb8DoTz36K1hm2zuDLIgqxiO0FheQn6VEVNiSiZCpVoMyYkyym_UXuNY_vIcZyyoS4lZb1ZsmoxnlbnHJ6Ow3BUaeaiejlNuoA2w&amp;csui=3&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjkpKbatMOSAxUFEDQIHTXdBy8QgK4QegQIARAD\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Watercress</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;(</span><i><em class=\"lexical-text-editor--italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Nasturtium officinale</em></i><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">) is&nbsp;a nutrient-dense, semi-aquatic perennial herb in the mustard family, known for its peppery, pungent, and tangy flavor. It is a popular, nutrient-packed salad green, garnish, and ingredient in soups and sandwiches. Rich in vitamins K, A, and C, it supports bone health, immune function, and has high antioxidant properties, often cited for its potential to lower cancer and heart disease risk.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grown by: Groundwork Organic Farm</span></p>",
